vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/77fb486074e948c8064d0a606785b0d6.mp4?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/4cc7367c6d290829c49280f06704f0ab.avif?t=1751980408\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Exciting Platforming Experience</strong> \u2013 <i>Alaric's Quest</i> offers classic platforming gameplay with <strong>precise jumps, challenging obstacles, and clever traps</strong>. You'll need to master jumping mechanics and carefully explore each level to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Variety of Levels and Challenges</strong> \u2013 The game features a <strong>wide range of levels</strong>, each with its own set of challenges and puzzles to solve. Face <strong>ferocious enemies, dodge deadly traps, and uncover hidden secrets</strong> as you explore the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Multi-Platform and Controller Support</strong> \u2013 <i>Alaric's Quest</i> is available for <strong>Linux, Windows, and SteamDeck</strong>, ensuring you can enjoy the adventure on your favorite devices. The game is also compatible with <strong>keyboard, gamepad, and touchscreen controls</strong>, offering flexibility in how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Accessible Yet Challenging Gameplay</strong> \u2013 The game features <strong>easy-to-learn controls</strong>, making it accessible to players of all ages and skill levels. However, as you progress, levels become <strong>increasingly difficult</strong>, testing even the most experienced players. Get ready to <strong>face clever traps and formidable enemies</strong> as you advance in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/0cf60530dae47b6953cd2473d6e055fd.poster.avif?t=1751980408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/0cf60530dae47b6953cd2473d6e055fd.webm?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/0cf60530dae47b6953cd2473d6e055fd.mp4?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
